          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na anyw’a mbinyu, akwatwa nĩyo: na eethĩwa evuĩte e ĩeemanĩ yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Amu, ĩthe wa Kanaani, oona ĩthe wake e mũthei, na atavya ana‐a‐inyia make elĩ me nza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Semu na Yavethi moosa ngũa, mailĩĩla ituonĩ syoo me elĩ, na mathi na kyamũtete, mavw’ĩka ĩthe woo e mũthei; na mothyũ moo melekele ĩtina, na matyaona ĩthe woo e mũthei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Noa aamũka kuma mbinyunĩ yake, na amanya ũndũ wĩkiwe nĩ mwana wake ũla mũnini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
